{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique among all puzzle games! Links is a Relaxing and Brain Challenging Puzzle Game.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a trip to a unique world, with a lot of logic and fun. If you think you are an intelligent person, you are in the right place. This brainteaser game will challenge your logical skills while you solve the target patterns.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, Smart, Addictive, Challenging, Relaxing and Fun game. All in one!\u00a0<br><br>Links will help you improve your ability to focus and to relax, while you develop your own strategy to solve puzzles.<br><br><i>The goal is simple:</i> Move every tile (whose moves are determined by its links with another tiles) until create the pattern suggested. Play this links puzzle once and just you won't be able to put it down.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Minimalist design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Smart level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a04 Game Modes: Classic, Switch color, Magic and Relaxing</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Classic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937540/ee2bfedaf7c43add57955d66df3210db8c660c60.jpg"},{"name":"Switch Color","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937540/3a0ceb6e7bded3f1069af655ccd847e9d2d383d5.jpg"},{"name":"Magic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937540/6c0c58bcb6733e067f76bfacc6635fa46a115f6b.jpg"},{"name":"Relaxing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937540/b0cbeeb21e69d05e41b153603ccb29dd825cb3db.jpg"},{"name":"On a Roll (x10)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937540/d670f6b83a941c907461da2978c1